From 60c5c3034f3adae083c486fb8c34cabd5b148231 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seedds <seedds@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 12:35:24 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] mac/menus: adapt James Sturges's menu and backup prerequisite

Adapt the in-game menu and backup/restore work from James Sturges's PR #921
(head f2401b4be6bed3ab231117bd5117d3f65a5b7d6e) to the prepared upstream
base 224ecb186960febfc361071bc1c3f181e20dbefb.

This is the dependency recorded for review of the native save importer,
not a replacement for PR #921 or new importer work. Keep it separate when
choosing the eventual upstream order. Checks on the combined feature are
recorded in the review evidence; this commit is not a new gameplay claim
for the menu adaptation alone.

Co-authored-by: James Sturges <james@sturges.dev>
